raph","text":"😴10月18日1.2.4.5.6部\n🐱10月25日3.5.6部\n🎃11月1日2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"となっております( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと仲良しネコになりたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしております！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🔗 https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka_202609/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ数日は月がとっても綺麗にみえる~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"瑶季"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#299\nInstagram @ishizukatamaki_official"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-49736":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobAq9p01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です🫧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、9thシングル「One choice」MVは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうご覧になって頂けましたでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【 https://youtu.be/0b1UKU8wPvw 】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑もう見たよっ！方も是非もう一度ご覧ください✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mob4t8k9K.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のMVは、MVの撮影の1日を撮影しちゃおう！\nという設定で行いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので最初はリハーサル着としてスポーティな服装、\n最後は本番仕様のドレスアップした衣装でダンスをしました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コミカルな部分もありますが、曲調は爽やかで\n今の季節にぴったりな曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"One choice！ということは、1択！ということ。\n春は出会いや別れの季節だと思いますが、\nみなさんの選んだワンチョイスが輝かしいもので\nありますようにと金村は願っています😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと無理やりかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひさまの皆様は日向坂1択！\nでいてくれたら嬉しいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは 恒例、みくふぉとたちをご紹介しますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobQUkhHF.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのみくにん🌱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は人狼がとっても流行った日で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋が2期・3期一緒だったのでみんなでやりましたね。なのちゃんはふいに笑い出す癖があってかなり惑わされました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobMUonGG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の合間にひさびさお会いできて、嬉しかった日。かなり遅めのバレンタインをやっとお渡しできました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんさんがいると空気がぱっと明るくなる\nそんな方です🌟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobMUfn5M.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なお〜\n今回フォーメーションが隣なので、よく目が合います。いつもその時にこって笑ってくれるから嬉しい☺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobkailY0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobKkR6N6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すずひよたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"限界まで顔近づけてにらめっこしてた。\nかわいいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobqNvwij.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりみくにぱる。\n後ろ姿ですぐ分かりますね。\nこの身長差初期から変わらず愛おしいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobQ9YTqL.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！センターにぶさん！\nやっぱりオレンジ着てほしかったから嬉しい🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV撮影の時のにぶさんはとてもカッコ良かったです。\n後ろから見た背中が本当頼もしくて、\n私は帰り道すごいなぁ私も頑張ろうって感化された日でもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非MVでたっぷりにぶさん味わって下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202303/mobEwcE1s.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のInstagramにもみくふぉとスライドリールを\n更新しております。ここには載せていない写真なので\n是非合わせてチェックしてみてください！↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■金村美玖公式Instagram📸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.instagram.com/miku_osushi/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"─────────────────"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break